  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 407.09 Requirements For Replacement of UST System Components",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 407.09 Requirements For Replacement of UST System Components.\n\n(a) Whenever an existing UST is removed, all applicable requirements of Env-Or 408.06 through Env-Or 408.10 shall be met prior to the installation of a new UST.\n\n(b) For steel USTs, the owner shall:\n\n(1) Thoroughly inspect the tank coating; and\n\n(2) Repair any scratches, gouges, voids, or other discontinuities found in the coating according to the manufacturer’s requirements prior to installation.\n\n(c) Whenever an existing tank is removed prior to the installation of a new tank, all system piping that does not meet the standards specified in Env-Or 405.02 and Env-Or 405.04 shall be closed in accordance with Env-Or 408.06 through Env-Or 408.10.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400) #10393, eff 9-1-18; ss by #12643, eff 10-10-18 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-or400.html"
